language sdl-mvp1-exercise version 0.1.

capability ReliableServiceExchange.
functionality FrameServiceMessages.
functionality NegotiateServiceSession.
functionality ManageServiceSubscription.
functionality ScheduleSubscriberDelivery.
functionality RecoverCommandLifecycle.
functionality PublishAccessCatalog.
functionality ShutdownServiceRuntime.

ServiceKit cites "https://github.com/Hans-Einar/ponsse/blob/7589a5811a21ec6bb13979612060ceff0f690df8/MVP1/shared/servicekit/SDP/03--Requirements/requirements.md".
ServiceKit provides ReliableServiceExchange.
ServiceKit owns FrameServiceMessages.
FrameServiceMessages realizes ReliableServiceExchange.
FrameServiceMessages specifies "Bounded length-delimited TCP framing handles partial/multiple reads, malformed lengths and shutdown.".
ServiceKit owns NegotiateServiceSession.
NegotiateServiceSession realizes ReliableServiceExchange.
NegotiateServiceSession specifies "Hello first, selected version or typed failure, handshake timeout, server-bound peer context.".
ServiceKit owns ManageServiceSubscription.
ManageServiceSubscription realizes ReliableServiceExchange.
ManageServiceSubscription specifies "One active subscription per connection; replace on second Subscribe; explicit Unsubscribe; typed live/resumed/snapshot-required/outside-retention.".
ServiceKit owns ScheduleSubscriberDelivery.
ScheduleSubscriberDelivery realizes ReliableServiceExchange.
ScheduleSubscriberDelivery specifies "Independent bounded subscriber queues; separate source and contiguous delivery sequence; family-specific non-supersedable/latest/diagnostic policy.".
ServiceKit owns RecoverCommandLifecycle.
RecoverCommandLifecycle realizes ReliableServiceExchange.
RecoverCommandLifecycle specifies "Same ID and semantic payload recovers known result without re-execution; conflict/expired/unknown are distinct; never invent a fresh retry ID.".
ServiceKit owns PublishAccessCatalog.
PublishAccessCatalog realizes ReliableServiceExchange.
PublishAccessCatalog specifies "Publish capabilities and scoped authority updates durably; only domain owners grant authority.".
ServiceKit owns ShutdownServiceRuntime.
ShutdownServiceRuntime realizes ReliableServiceExchange.
ShutdownServiceRuntime specifies "Deterministically close sessions and cancel owned work while draining or reporting required durable output.".
